 "applies_to": "Midea V8 series VRF outdoor units connected through the GW3-BAC gateway.",
 "summary": "The Midea GW3-BAC gateway serves V8 VRF systems on BACnet IP and creates one virtual BACnet device per outdoor unit. Each outdoor-unit device has 42 objects: on/off and fault status, mode, fan speeds and status, outdoor temperature, compressor frequencies, status, discharge temperatures and currents, high and low pressure, error code, EXV openings, solenoid valves, auxiliary electric heaters and an emergency-stop command.",
